<title>USA: AOL Europe passes 300,000 subscribers.</title>
<headline>AOL Europe passes 300,000 subscribers.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AOL Europe, a joint venture of America Online Inc and Bertelsmann AG, said on Wednesday it has 300,000 subscribers in Europe.</p>
<p>The venture said AOL Europe's German membership has reached nearly 200,000 subscribers, U.K. subscribers are approaching 100,000, and AOL France has about 25,000 members.</p>
<p>The company said it passed the 300,000 mark in less than 12 months since the launch of its first service in Germany.</p>
<p>The venture also said it will now provide local dial-up access to consumers in Austria and Switzerland. In January, 1997, the company will offer access to Sweden.</p>
</text>
